COMPILATION OF: E52XH

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52XH

   1 a 0000 E52XH: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* E2E-52/P3-11 probe XH (PLAN H-H): PRINT open +
   3 a 0006       BARE skip.  E46N1 measures 20 B (attach 12,
   4 a 0006       MVI A,01 + ?SKPOP 5, ?QIOOP 3) on the stream
   5 a 0006       route; does the shape ride unchanged here? */
   6 c 0006    dcl pf file;
   7 c 0006    dcl x fixed bin;
   8 c 0006    open file(pf) print;
   9 c 001B    put file(pf) skip;
  10 c 002F    x = 2;
  11 a 0035 end E52XH;

CODE SIZE = 0038
DATA AREA = 0002
FREE SYMS = 38C5
END  COMPILATION
